    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in either player's [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), right after an enemy unit picks its targets. Pick 1 **GREY KNIGHTS INFANTRY** unit of yours that at least 1 of those attacks targets.\n\nFor the rest of the phase, whenever 1 of its models is destroyed before it has fought this phase, roll a D6. If the result beats the [battle round](vsdata:core-rule/the-battle-round) number:\n\n1. Leave the model in play.\n2. It can fight once the attacking unit has made all its attacks.\n3. Then remove it.",
